{
  "Data Preparation": "数据准备",
  "Registration": "配准",
  "ROI Quantification": "ROI 定量分析",
  "Kinetic Analysis": "动力学分析",
  "In the Data Preparation step, you can visualize the dynamic PT volume data in three orthogonal views: axial, sagittal, and coronal. Use the left panel controls to adjust the visualization settings, such as playback speed, or navigate between different frames. This step allows you to assess the quality of the PT data and prepare for further analysis or registration with other modalities.": "在数据准备步骤中，您可以在三个正交视图（轴位、矢状位、冠状位）中查看动态 PET 容积数据。使用左侧面板控件调整可视化设置（如播放速度）或在不同帧之间切换。此步骤可用于评估 PT 数据的质量，并为后续分析或与其他模态配准做好准备。",
  "The Registration step provides a comprehensive view of the CT, PT, and fused CT-PT volume data in multiple orientations. The fusion viewports display the CT and PT volumes overlaid, allowing you to visually assess the alignment and registration between the two modalities. The individual CT and PT viewports are also available for side-by-side comparison. This step is crucial for ensuring proper registration before proceeding with further analysis or quantification.": "配准步骤提供多方向的 CT、PT 以及融合 CT-PT 容积数据的综合视图。融合视口显示叠加的 CT 和 PT 容积，让您直观评估两种模态之间的对齐和配准情况。同时提供单独的 CT 和 PT 视口进行并排比较。这一步对于在进一步分析或定量之前确保正确配准至关重要。",
  "The ROI quantification step allows you to define regions of interest (ROIs) with labelmap segmentations, on the fused CT-PT volume data using the labelmap tools. The left panel provides controls for adjusting the dynamic volume visualization, while the right panel offers tools for segmentation, editing, and exporting the ROI data. This step enables you to quantify the uptake or other measures within the defined ROIs for further analysis.": "ROI 定量分析步骤允许您使用标签图工具在融合 CT-PT 容积数据上通过标签图分割来定义感兴趣区域（ROI）。左侧面板提供调整动态容积可视化的控件，右侧面板提供分割、编辑和导出 ROI 数据的工具。此步骤使您能够量化已定义 ROI 内的摄取或其他指标，用于进一步分析。",
  "The Kinetic Analysis step provides a comprehensive view for visualizing and analyzing the dynamic data derived from the ROI segmentations. The fusion viewports display the combined CT-PT volume data, while a dedicated viewport shows a series chart representing the data over time. This step allows you to explore the temporal dynamics of the uptake or other kinetic measures within the defined regions of interest, enabling further quantitative analysis and modeling.": "动力学分析步骤提供综合视图，用于可视化和分析从 ROI 分割得出的动态数据。融合视口显示组合的 CT-PT 容积数据，同时有一个专用视口显示表示数据随时间变化的序列图表。此步骤允许您探索已定义感兴趣区域内摄取或其他动力学指标的时间动态，便于进行进一步的定量分析和建模。"
}
